Census Bureau statistics are U.S. government works.

This product uses the Census Bureau Data API but is not endorsed or certified by the Census Bureau.

This plugin sends HTTPS requests to api.census.gov, geocoding.geo.census.gov, and tigerweb.geo.census.gov. It does not copy Census web pages into the tool result.

A free CENSUS_API_KEY is required for estimate queries. Request one at https://www.census.gov/data/developers/guidance/api-user-guide.API_Key.html

The key stays in the profile .env. This repository does not contain a key.
